---
/*
 * Wave 9 · shader mount point:
 * - .fx-backdrop hosts the full-viewport Ink-in-Water canvas ONLY in full tier on fine pointers.
 *   No <canvas> is emitted in HTML so lite/off tiers and reduced-motion never allocate one.
 * - .fx-film-overlay supplies the subtle film grain (static on lite/off, shimmering on full)
 *   and stock-aware vignette.
 */
---
<div class="fx-backdrop" data-fx-backdrop aria-hidden="true"></div>
<div class="fx-film-overlay" data-fx-film aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="fx-film-grain"></div>
  <div class="fx-film-vignette"></div>
</div>
